usage: thaivia acquire [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--area AREA]
                       [--from-url FROM_URL]
                       [--from-local-file FROM_LOCAL_FILE]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       Path to an area config (default: configs/pilot-
                        area.json). Ignored if --area is given.
  --area AREA           Registered area id from configs/areas/index.json
                        (G6-01). Default (omitted): th-bkk-pilot-001 via
                        --config, unchanged from before this flag existed.
  --from-url FROM_URL   Download a bounded extract from this URL (network
                        path; honors acquire_budget)
  --from-local-file FROM_LOCAL_FILE
                        Ingest an already-obtained local .osm.pbf/.osm.xml
                        (offline path)
